+   Set global shader integer `_CVCT_GridResolutionI` to `gridResolution`.
+   Set compute shader integers: `GridResolution` and `GridHalfResolution` (`gridResolution / 2`).
+   Bind `cb_gv` to `CVCT_gv` in all kernels.
